{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41471","headline":"中春写怀寄沈彬员外 · 李建勳","name":"中春写怀寄沈彬员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"省从骑竹学讴吟，便殢光阴役此心。\n寓目不能闲一日，闭门长胜得千金。\n窗悬夜雨残灯在，庭掩春风落絮深。\n唯有故人同此兴，近来何事嬾相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}